title CallMateTool Resolution and Credential Forwarding (Pending implementation)

' Source evidence (pi-mono-java 21c3f59be033e7bdd5506a2d9d48baa2581bc3c7):
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/tool/mate/CallMateTool.java: execute.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/tool/mate/MateToolSessionCache.java.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/common/client/HttpMateToolClient.java:
' invokeTool and toHeaderInfo.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeRequestContext.java: mateCredentials.
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeEventService.java: requireCredentials.
' Observed behavior: RuntimeEventService, CallMateTool and HttpMateToolClient reject incomplete credentials.
' Pending implementation: remove local completeness checks; only Mate decides credential validity.
' Security hardening: only one Mate execute request receives the POST Events execution snapshot.
' Design reason: discovery may retry, but execute and its credential exposure occur at most once.

actor Model
participant "CallMateTool" as Call
participant "Session resolution cache" as Cache
participant "Session single-flight" as Flight
participant "MateToolClient" as Client
participant "Mate APIs" as Mate

== Resolve a tool name ==
Model -> Call : {tool, args?}
Call -> Cache : resolve(toolName)
alt cache hit
  Cache --> Call : toolId
else cache miss
  Cache --> Call : missing
  Call -> Flight : join or start full discovery
  activate Flight
  Flight -> Client : listAgentTools(currentAgentId)
  Client -> Mate : discover Agent tools\nno execution credential headers
  Mate --> Client : ordered records
  Client --> Flight : Agent records
  loop every directly bound Skill
    Flight -> Client : listSkillTools(skillId)
    Client -> Mate : discover Skill tools\nno execution credential headers
    Mate --> Client : ordered records
    Client --> Flight : Skill records
  end
  Flight -> Flight : merge all sources
  alt same name maps to different IDs
    Flight --> Call : discovery conflict
    Call --> Model : isError=true
  else every source succeeded
    Flight -> Cache : atomically replace full snapshot
    Flight --> Call : discovery complete
    Call -> Cache : resolve(toolName) again
    alt still missing
      Cache --> Call : missing
      Call --> Model : isError=true
    else resolved
      Cache --> Call : toolId
    end
  else discovery failed
    Flight --> Call : error; old snapshot retained
    Call --> Model : isError=true
  end
  deactivate Flight
end

== Execute at most once ==
opt toolId resolved and execution allowed
  Call -> Client : callTool(resolved ID, args, possibly empty snapshot)
  Client -> Mate : execute once; provided non-empty headers only
  Mate --> Client : validate credentials; result or error
  Client --> Call : ToolResult; isError=true on failure
  Call --> Model : ToolResultMessage
end

note over Mate
  Never replay execute after timeout,
  disconnect, or Mate error. No local completeness check.
  Never send execution credentials to discovery.
end note
@enduml

